  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <main class=\"p-index\">\n   <section class=\"hero\">\n    <p>Not just servers in Europe. A European company, European infrastructure, and European values — from deploy to CDN.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero__cta\">\n     <a href=\"https://builder.statichost.eu/signup\" class=\"button button--cta\">Deploy now</a> <a href=\"https://www.statichost.eu/docs/\" class=\"button button--outline\">Explore the docs</a>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n   <h2>Trusted by</h2>\n   <ul class=\"logo-wall\">\n    <li><a class=\"logo-wall__logo\" href=\"https://plural.at\" target=\"_blank\"> <img srcset=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-plural_hu_478e12cfe15c2b48.png 1x, https://www.statichost.eu/logo-plural_hu_4003dc54a85cc953.png 2x\" src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-plural_hu_478e12cfe15c2b48.png\" alt=\"Wir sind Plural logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a>\n     <div class=\"logo-wall__description\">Design studio for global brands including Braun and Oral-B. Strategic concept development with digital precision.</div></li>\n    <li><a class=\"logo-wall__logo\" href=\"https://www.techtransparencyproject.org\" target=\"_blank\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-ttp.svg\" alt=\"Tech Transparency Project logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a>\n     <div class=\"logo-wall__description\">Information and research hub seeking to hold large technology companies accountable.</div></li>\n    <li><a class=\"logo-wall__logo\" href=\"https://freesewing.eu\" target=\"_blank\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-freesewing.svg\" alt=\"FreeSewing logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a>\n     <div class=\"logo-wall__description\">\n      Open source bespoke sewing patterns for hundreds of thousands of registered users.\n      <p class=\"logo-wall__more\"><a href=\"https://www.statichost.eu/blog/freesewing-success-story/\">Read more</a></p>\n     </div></li>\n    <li><a class=\"logo-wall__logo\" href=\"https://junit.org\" target=\"_blank\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-junit.svg\" alt=\"JUnit logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a>\n     <div class=\"logo-wall__description\">Possibly the most well-known testing framework in the world.</div></li>\n   </ul>\n   <h2 id=\"features\">Everything you expect from modern static site hosting</h2>\n   <ul>\n    <li><img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/code.svg\" alt=\"Code icon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <h3 id=\"deploy-directly-from-your-git-repository\">Deploy directly from your git repository</h3>\n     We’ll build your site using any static site generator, and publish it for the world to see.</li>\n    <li><img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/sync.svg\" alt=\"Sync icon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <h3 id=\"update-your-site-based-on-webhooks\">Update your site based on webhooks</h3>\n     Re-build after a git push, after an update to your CMS, or whenever you like.</li>\n    <li><img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/lock.svg\" alt=\"Lock icon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <h3 id=\"custom-domains-with-free-ssl-certificates\">Custom domains with free SSL certificates</h3>\n     Use your own domain (naturally!), complete with an automatically provisioned SSL certificate.</li>\n    <li><img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/preview.svg\" alt=\"Preview icon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <h3 id=\"preview-links-for-branches-and-pull-requests-coming-soon\">Preview links for branches and pull requests <em>coming soon</em></h3>\n     Want to see how your new update looks or share it with your team before releasing it to production? No problem, we have a preview for you.</li>\n    <li><img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/rollback.svg\" alt=\"Rollback icon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <h3 id=\"instant-rollbacks\">Instant rollbacks</h3>\n     Roll back to a previous version of your site, effective immediately.</li>\n    <li><img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/cdn.svg\" alt=\"CDN icon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <h3 id=\"world-wide-cdn-private-beta\">World-wide CDN <em>private beta</em></h3>\n     Ensure user privacy and GDPR compliance while always serving your users from a location close to them, wherever that may be.</li>\n   </ul>\n   <p><a href=\"https://www.statichost.eu/docs/\">Read the documentation</a></p>\n   <section class=\"works-with\">\n    <h2>Your tools, your workflow</h2>\n    <p>Every git provider. Every static site generator. If it builds to static files, it works on statichost.eu.</p>\n    <ul class=\"works-with__grid\">\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"GitHub\" title=\"GitHub\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://gitlab.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"GitLab\" title=\"GitLab\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-gitlab.svg\" alt=\"GitLab logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://bitbucket.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Bitbucket\" title=\"Bitbucket\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-bitbucket.svg\" alt=\"Bitbucket logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://forgejo.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Forgejo\" title=\"Forgejo\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-forgejo.svg\" alt=\"Forgejo logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://sourcehut.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"SourceHut\" title=\"SourceHut\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-sourcehut.svg\" alt=\"SourceHut logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://dev.azure.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Azure DevOps\" title=\"Azure DevOps\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-azure-devops.svg\" alt=\"Azure DevOps logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://gohugo.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Hugo\" title=\"Hugo\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-hugo.svg\" alt=\"Hugo logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://jekyllrb.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Jekyll\" title=\"Jekyll\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-jekyll.svg\" alt=\"Jekyll logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://astro.build\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Astro\" title=\"Astro\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-astro.svg\" alt=\"Astro logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://nextjs.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Next.js\" title=\"Next.js\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-nextjs.svg\" alt=\"Next.js logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://www.gatsbyjs.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Gatsby\" title=\"Gatsby\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-gatsby.svg\" alt=\"Gatsby logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://nuxt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Nuxt\" title=\"Nuxt\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-nuxt.svg\" alt=\"Nuxt logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://www.11ty.dev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Eleventy\" title=\"Eleventy\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-eleventy.svg\" alt=\"Eleventy logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n     <li><a class=\"works-with__link\" href=\"https://www.getzola.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Zola\" title=\"Zola\"> <img src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/logo-zola.svg\" alt=\"Zola logo\" loading=\"lazy\"> </a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <p><em>... and all others!</em></p>\n   </section>\n   <div class=\"main-section\">\n    <div class=\"card card--secondary card--image card--wide\">\n     <img srcset=\"https://www.statichost.eu/eric.jpg 1x, https://www.statichost.eu/eric.jpg 2x\" src=\"https://www.statichost.eu/eric.jpg\" alt=\"Eric on stage at Nordic.js\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     <div>\n      <p>Hi, fellow web developer!</p>\n      <p>My name is Eric, and I believe the internet got too complicated. Too many layers, too many vendors, too much trust quietly handed to American companies behind the scenes. And it matters who’s behind your infrastructure — and where it lives.</p>\n      <p>I got tired of “European” hosting that runs on American clouds. So I built an alternative — static hosting where every layer of the stack, from git deploy to CDN, runs on European infrastructure owned by European companies. No AWS, no Cloudflare, no exceptions.</p>\n      <p>Greetings from Stockholm,\n       <br>\n       Eric Selin, Founder, statichost.eu</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"card card--cta\">\n    <h2 id=\"get-started-for-free\">Get started for free!</h2>\n    <p>Deploy your first site for free. European infrastructure, your domain, 2 minutes.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"https://builder.statichost.eu/signup\" class=\"button button--cta\">Deploy now</a></p>\n   </div>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "statichost.eu 提供完全基于欧洲的静态网站托管解决方案，从部署到 CDN，确保数据隐私并符合欧洲法规，同时支持多种 git 提供商和静态网站生成器。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "statichost.eu 提供完全基于欧洲的静态网站托管解决方案，从部署到 CDN，确保数据隐私并符合欧洲法规，同时支持多种 git 提供商和静态网站生成器。",
  "summary": "statichost.eu 是一个以 100% 欧洲化为傲的静态网站托管服务。它提供完整的托管栈，包括从 git 仓库部署、全球 CDN 和 SSL 证书，同时确保数据始终留在欧盟境内。该服务支持多种静态网站生成器和 git 提供商，是寻求隐私保护的开发者的多功能选择。",
  "mainPoints": [
